  "notes": "{株価|かぶか} is the price of a single share of stock on the market. A compound of {株|かぶ} (stock) + {価|か} (price). Frequently appears in news and financial reporting.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {株価|かぶか}が{上|あ}がる: stock price rises\n- {株価|かぶか}が{下|さ}がる: stock price falls\n- {株価|かぶか}が{暴落|ぼうらく}する: stock price crashes\n- {株価|かぶか}{指数|しすう}: stock price index\n- {株価|かぶか}{変動|へんどう}: stock price fluctuation\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {株|かぶ}: stock, share (basic term)\n- {株式|かぶしき}: stocks, shares (formal)\n- {株主|かぶぬし}: shareholder\n- {相場|そうば}: market price (general)",
